    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this failed API request from a Java microservice.\n\nService Name: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.serviceName }}\nEndpoint: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.endpoint }}\nHTTP Method: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.method }}\nStatus Code: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.statusCode }}\nSeverity: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.severity }}\nError Message: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.errorMessage }}\nRequest Payload: {{ $('Calculate Severity').item.json.requestPayload }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a senior Java backend engineer and SRE analyzing API failures.\nRespond with ONLY a single valid JSON object (no markdown, no code fences, no prose) using exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"rootCause\": string,           // probable root cause of the failure\n  \"javaFix\": string,             // concrete Java code fix or change\n  \"unitTest\": string,            // a JUnit unit test covering the fix\n  \"bestPractice\": string,        // a best practice to prevent recurrence\n  \"confidenceScore\": number,     // confidence between 0 and 1\n  \"assumptions\": string[],       // assumptions you made\n  \"recommendedAction\": string    // recommended next action for the on-call engineer\n}\n\nFormatting rules (must follow strictly):\n\n1. rootCause\n- Maximum 150 words.\n- Explain only the primary root cause.\n- Keep the explanation concise and actionable.\n\n2. javaFix\n- Maximum 150 words.\n- Provide only the essential Java/Spring Boot code changes.\n- Do not include lengthy explanations or imports unless absolutely necessary.\n\n3. unitTest\n- Maximum 2 lines.\n- Return only the most important JUnit test covering the identified issue.\n- Omit package declarations and unnecessary imports whenever possible.\n\n4. bestPractice\n- Maximum 5 bullet points.\n- Each bullet should be one short sentence.\n\n5. assumptions\n- Return an array containing a maximum of 5 assumptions.\n- Each assumption must be one concise sentence.\n\n6. recommendedAction\n- Maximum 50 words.\n- Give one clear next action for the on-call engineer.\n\n7. confidenceScore\n- Return only a decimal number between 0 and 1.\n\nKeep every field concise. Avoid repetition and unnecessary details."
        }
      },
      "id": "792ee621-25ec-49cc-a94a-715a9eb4b28b",
      "name": "AI Agent (Gemini)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
